  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Sam has a red toy helicopter. Sam and Ben are at the pond. Grandpa is there too. He sits under a big tree. Grandpa likes fishing. \"Look, Ben!\" says Sam. \"The helicopter can fly!\" The red helicopter flies and flies. Ben claps his hands.",
      "Then the helicopter stops. It goes in the water. \"Oh no!\" says Sam. Ben looks at the water. \"I can see a big thing,\" says Ben. \"Is that a monster?\" It is a big gray fish. \"It is not a monster,\" says Sam. \"It is a fish!\" The fish looks at the helicopter.",
      "\"Grandpa, can you catch it?\" asks Sam. Grandpa goes to the water. He has his things for fishing. Grandpa catches the red helicopter. \"Thank you, Grandpa!\" says Sam. \"Good fishing!\" says Ben. Pip says, \"Woof!\" The sun is orange now. It is a nice day at the pond. Sam, Ben, and Grandpa are happy."
    ],
